<h2 id="-about-the-project">📖 About the Project</h2>
<p>Cars4U is a web-based application, built as part of the <em>ASP.NET Fundamentals</em> course, using the ASP.NET technology, MVC architecture and Entity Framework technology. Cars4U is a car selling platform, similar to a famous bulgarian car selling platform. In Cars4U users can be registered in the machine local SQL database server.  </p>
