<h2 id="-getting-started">🚀 Getting Started</h2>
<p>Follow these steps to get the project running locally.</p>
<h3 id="1-clone-the-repository">1. Clone the repository</h3>
<pre><code class="lang-bash">git <span class="hljs-keyword">clone</span> <span class="hljs-title">https</span>://github.com/ackodavidoff-png/Cars4U.git
cd Cars4U
</code></pre>
<h3 id="2-restore-dependencies">2. Restore dependencies</h3>
<pre><code class="lang-bash">dotnet <span class="hljs-built_in">restore</span>
</code></pre>
<h3 id="3-apply-database-migrations">3. Apply database migrations</h3>
<pre><code class="lang-bash"><span class="hljs-attribute">dotnet ef database update</span>
</code></pre>
<h3 id="4-run-the-application">4. Run the application</h3>
<pre><code class="lang-bash">dotnet <span class="hljs-keyword">run</span><span class="bash"></span>
</code></pre>
<p>The app will be available at <code>https://localhost:5001</code> or <code>http://localhost:5000</code>.</p>
