<h2 id="-features">✨ Features</h2>
<ul>
    <li>[ ] User registration and login (ASP.NET Identity)</li>
    <li>[ ] Create car (Login required)</li>
    <li>[ ] Preview car</li>
    <li>[ ] Edit car (Login required)</li>
    <li>[ ] Delete car (Login required)</li>
    <li>[ ] RESTful API endpoints</li>
    <li>[ ] Input validation (server-side &amp; client-side)</li>
    <li>[ ] Responsive UI with Bootstrap</li>
</ul>
